 "description": {
  "id": "Alur formulir yang hidup. Mode daftar: tombol akun sosial, surel dan kata sandi diketik dengan cincin fokus, tombol kirim ditekan, berputar, lalu kartu sukses bercentang. Mode onboarding: rel tonggak terisi, kartu langkah bergeser, tombol Lanjut ditekan tiap tahap. Mode masukan: isian salah bergetar merah dengan pesan galat, dihapus lewat tombol silang, diketik ulang lalu berubah hijau valid.",
  "en": "Living form flows. Signup mode: social button, email and password typed with focus rings, submit presses and spins into a success card. Onboarding mode: a milestone rail fills while step cards slide and the Next button is pressed. Feedback mode: a wrong entry shakes red with an error, is cleared by the x affordance, retyped and turns green."
 },
